      "definition": "Piotroski (2000) F-score: sum of nine indicators on annual data (f_roa ib/at_t-1 > 0; f_cfo oancf/at_t-1 > 0; f_droa change in roa > 0; f_accrual cfo > roa; f_dlever change in dltt / average at < 0; f_dliquid change in current ratio > 0; f_eqoff sstk = 0; f_dmargin change in gross margin > 0; f_dturn change in sale/at_t-1 > 0); NULL unless all nine are defined",
